{"type": "message", "id": "19dfbd43", "parentId": "3392db4e", "timestamp": "2026-04-16T14:17:22.423Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "functions.web_search:4", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"mesothelioma glioblastoma esophageal cancer liver cancer stomach cancer 5 year survival rates\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"tookMs\": 1143,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c1b44d57e3ebea12\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nCancer Survival Rates by Type and Stage | American Cancer Fund\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c1b44d57e3ebea12\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://americancancerfund.org/cancer-survival-rates/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"e553b2fcc88b482c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n<strong>Liver cancer: approximately 22% overall 5-year survival rate</strong>. Esophageal cancer: approximately 22% overall 5-year survival rate. Pancreatic cancer: approximately 13% overall 5-year survival rate.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"e553b2fcc88b482c\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"2 weeks ago\",\n      \"siteName\": \"americancancerfund.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"130b62b76bfae375\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nSurvival Rates for Pleural Mesothelioma | American Cancer Society\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"130b62b76bfae375\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.cancer.org/cancer/types/malignant-mesothelioma/detection-diagnosis-staging/survival-statistics.html\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"95c2b332cde6c182\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nFor example, if the 5-year relative survival rate for a specific stage of <strong>pleural mesothelioma is 30%, it means that people who have that cancer are, on average, about 30%</strong> as likely as people who don’t have that cancer to live for at least 5 years after being diagnosed.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"95c2b332cde6c182\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"February 3, 2026\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.cancer.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"336d23131d3cafee\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMesothelioma Life Expectancy & Survival Rate in 2026\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"336d23131d3cafee\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.sokolovelaw.com/mesothelioma/life-expectancy/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5d150058ff6bd139\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAccording to the American Cancer Society (ACS), the 5-year survival rate (or the percentage of people who live 5 years past diagnosis) for people with mesothelioma is <strong>between 5 and 10 percent</strong>.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5d150058ff6bd139\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"1 week ago\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.sokolovelaw.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"64f4069bb6ee365c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMesothelioma Survival Rate: What Impacts a Patient's Survival Time?\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"64f4069bb6ee365c\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.asbestos.com/mesothelioma/survival-rate/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b41af66f437eb938\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe average survival rate for mesothelioma is about 18 months after diagnosis with treatment. <strong>The 5-year survival rate for pleural mesothelioma is approximately 12%</strong>. Some patients have lived for more than 10 years after treatment.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b41af66f437eb938\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"April 10, 2013\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.asbestos.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d60e97a06c9b7778\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMesothelioma Prognosis | Stage 1 to Stage 4 Survival Rates (2026)\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d60e97a06c9b7778\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.sokolovelaw.com/mesothelioma/prognosis/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"59efff67478d6dd9\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMesothelioma patients in stage 3 have a median life expectancy of 16 months and 5-year survival rate of <strong>11%</strong>. Stage 3 mesothelioma is usually too advanced for mesothelioma oncologists (cancer doctors) to safely and effectively remove through ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"59efff67478d6dd9\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"1 week ago\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.sokolovelaw.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"9eaaf9f6ece8b90d\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMesothelioma Survival Rate | Moffitt\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"9eaaf9f6ece8b90d\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.moffitt.org/cancers/mesothelioma/survival-rate/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"fa3496e84e9eed7b\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAs of 2022, the overall five-year survival rate for advanced stage mesothelioma at Moffitt Cancer Center is <strong>17.3%</strong>. Most cases are diagnosed when the cancer is in an advanced stage and is more difficult to treat.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"fa3496e84e9eed7b\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.moffitt.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"fd2c58f3127254f7\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMesothelioma Life Expectancy | Factors & Ways to Improve\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"fd2c58f3127254f7\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.mesotheliomahope.com/mesothelioma/pr